        "answer": {
          "short": "$5$",
          "worked": "$$10a+5=5(2a+1)$$\nThe unknown measurement is the area divided by the known side:\n$$\\frac{5(2a+1)}{2a+1}=5$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 20
